  "request": "Goal: add failurePolicy to the flow definition and introduce an acceptance-review step. Scope: update src/flow/definition.js so phases/steps can declare retry/block/record/amend-spec policy; add acceptance-review after retro and before final-regression with maxAttempts 1; define acceptance artifact, findings, requirementAmendmentProposals, mechanicalBlockers, hardBlockers, and verdict values pass/amend_required/user_decision_required/blocked; route amend_required through spec amendment and implementation retry without routine approval; route user_decision_required and blocked through explicit user choices; preserve normal impl-review retry behavior while allowing record policy structure for comparative validation. Out of Scope: split the issue, add roundLimit terminology, place acceptance-review after final-regression, or make normal impl-review record/no-loop by default. Validation: tests must cover flow definition failurePolicy, acceptance-review position and maxAttempts, artifact/verdict schema, and transitions for pass/amend_required/user_decision_required/blocked.",
